(The black Mononoke is)

6
00:00:23,918 --> 00:00:25,169
(breathing inside me)

7
00:00:25,194 --> 00:00:27,737
(We ain't down with your noble conspiracy)

8
00:00:27,762 --> 00:00:30,319
(照亮的燈火  Feel the blood heat)

9
00:00:30,344 --> 00:00:33,450
(無聲無影地在此處綻放)

10
00:00:33,479 --> 00:00:36,302
(晃來晃去的upside down)

11
00:00:36,327 --> 00:00:38,907
(Clap  Clap  Bow to 祭壇)

12
00:00:38,932 --> 00:00:41,385
(I'm sick of this world and their pure spite)

13
00:00:41,410 --> 00:00:42,731
(You're gonna die from)

14
00:00:42,756 --> 00:00:44,342
(a thousand small bites)

15
00:00:44,594 --> 00:00:49,659
(Need no reason to walk along)

16
00:00:50,317 --> 00:00:54,063
(Or linger here to hear her song)

17
00:00:54,088 --> 00:00:56,312
(Split the dream)

18
00:00:56,337 --> 00:00:59,497
(and paint the silence apart)

19
00:00:59,522 --> 00:01:04,293
(Just please tie me to your heart)

20
